      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "Thanks for reporting this! Being able to create folders inside the VCC's installation folder is definitely not intended - and neither is having the projects deleted.\n\nI'm glad the user had backups, but we'll want to fix this in the future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
