  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-25T15:16:22.750Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Don't worry, it wasn't me who learned about this bug. Someone in the VRChat discord had this issue. When the VCC updated to a new version, all of their projects got wiped, because they were merged inside of the VCC folder.\nThe user, Ziggor says this:\n\"When you make a new folder within the VRChat Creator Companion folder to put projects in, it will completely wipe all of that when updating. You might want to make it so that either: \n1. the CC won't open any projects at all if they are located inside the main folder of the CC. Or \n2, not completely wipe/reinstall the entirety of the CC folder, but just the things that have changed, leaving any user created folders there",
